<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The keys the generated Info.plist cannot carry: the game archive's type, and
  the Wi-Fi Aware service declaration.

  GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE stays on and this file is its base, so every
  INFOPLIST_KEY_* build setting still lands in the built plist and only what is
  written here is written by hand.

  docs/game-data.md fixes all three parts of the declaration — the extension,
  the identifier, and the conformance to public.json — and UTType
  .miniXiangqiGame in History/GameFile.swift is the same identifier spelled for
  Swift. The two must agree; this file is what registers the type with the
  system, and the Swift constant only names it.

  It is exported rather than imported because this application defines the type,
  and it is deliberately not accompanied by CFBundleDocumentTypes: declaring the
  type is not claiming to open one. Import happens on the History destination,
  where the list is already on screen to receive the result, and a Finder or
  Files handler would be a second entry path with its own launch-time state that
  no accepted contract asks for.

  WiFiAwareServices declares the nearby-play service: `_boardgame._tcp`,
  Publishable and Subscribable because both peers run the publisher and the
  subscriber together. Apple crashes the app on an invalid service name (RFC
  6763 §4.1.2 / RFC 6335 §5.1). The com.apple.developer.wifi-aware entitlement
  in MiniXiangqi-iOS.entitlements is this declaration's other half; only iPhone
  and iPad sign with it.

  NSBonjourServices and NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription are the other path's two
  halves: the same service name, because it names the same thing, and the
  sentence the system's own permission alert explains itself by. The sentence is
  localized in InfoPlist.xcstrings, which is the string of record for it; the
  value here is the development language's. It says what the access is for and
  names no transport, no band and no path, as the interaction contract requires
  of every word this application writes.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>WiFiAwareServices</key>
	<dict>
		<key>_boardgame._tcp</key>
		<dict>
			<key>Publishable</key>
			<dict/>
			<key>Subscribable</key>
			<dict/>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>NSBonjourServices</key>
	<array>
		<string>_boardgame._tcp</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Used to find and connect to the other player's device for Nearby Play.</string>
	<key>UTExportedTypeDeclarations</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>UTTypeIdentifier</key>
			<string>com.chentianren.minixiangqi.game</string>
			<key>UTTypeDescription</key>
			<string>Mini Xiangqi Game</string>
			<key>UTTypeConformsTo</key>
			<array>
				<string>public.json</string>
			</array>
			<key>UTTypeTagSpecification</key>
			<dict>
				<key>public.filename-extension</key>
				<array>
					<string>mxq</string>
				</array>
				<key>public.mime-type</key>
				<array>
					<string>application/vnd.minixiangqi.game+json</string>
				</array>
			</dict>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
